<task id="065" project="email-communication-intelligence-r2">
  <metadata>
    <title>E2b/E2c — Fields tab type-correct controls (date/optionset/lookup) + "+ Update other fields" record form</title>
    <phase>5 Pillar E — Reconciliation UI (mount build, UAT round-2)</phase>
    <gate>none — prototype approved; OOB self-resolve, NO BFF, no new host prop</gate>
    <status>completed</status>
    <rigor>FULL</rigor>
    <rigor-reason>TEST-MODIFYING + modifies .tsx in shared Communication.Components; typed-control matrix + navigateTo; Step 9.5 unconditional.</rigor-reason>
    <model-tier>opus</model-tier>
    <model-tier-reason>Typed-control matrix driven by async Dataverse attribute metadata + graceful degradation across 4 control types; higher judgment than a single-control change.</model-tier-reason>
    <effort>high</effort>
    <parallel-safe>false</parallel-safe>
    <parallel-reason>Shared Spaarke.Communication.Components (hot-path); sequential main-session; /conflict-check before PR.</parallel-reason>
    <deps>055,063</deps>
    <tags>react, typescript, frontend, fluent-ui, testing</tags>
    <estimated-effort>3-5 hours</estimated-effort>
